  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for the EU Justice Reform (JURE) Programme in Srilanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objectives of this contract are as follows: (1) to mobilize high-level technical assistance to provide advisory services, thematic expertise and strategic guidance to the EU Delegation to Sri Lanka/Maldives in relation to the implementation of the EU-funded justice reform support programme, (2)to facilitate policy dialogue and donor coordination in the sector, in close collaboration with relevant Ministries/governmental agencies/institutions and the project implementing partners</narrative>
  </description>
